From: Valentine Burley <valentine.burley@collabora.com>
Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 032] panvk: Query modifier capabilities for format property advertisement

Purpose: format properties from modifier caps; BC stays optimal-only (dep of 6409a5b16af)
Source/Reference: upstream Mesa commit 98ed811046b (author preserved)
Backport-of: 98ed811046b
Conflict: csf-v11/022 BC formats stay optimal-only; no DRM modifiers advertised for BC
Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC6 (0xb8a31030, PAN_ARCH 11)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Mesa base range: 5a07217f034b3e50d8c7c7794f97a2df1742613b
Dependencies: csf-v11/031
Validation test: device matrix; icc.c modifier cases

